f your Lord would you deny?"}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"رَبُّ","d":"rabbu","e":"Lord"},{"c":"الْمَشْرِقَيْنِ","d":"l-mashriqayni","e":"(of) the two Easts"},{"c":"وَرَبُّ","d":"warabbu","e":"and Lord"},{"c":"الْمَغْرِبَيْنِ","d":"l-maghribayni","e":"(of) the two Wests"}],"a":{"g":"[He is] Lord of the two sunrises and Lord of the two sunsets."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"فَبِأَيِّ","d":"fabi-ayyi","e":"So which"},{"c":"ءَالَاءِ","d":"ālāi","e":"(of the) favors"},{"c":"رَبِّكُمَا","d":"rabbikumā","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"تُكَذِّبَانِ","d":"tukadhibāni","e":"will you both deny"}],"a":{"g":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny?"}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"مَرَجَ","d":"maraja","e":"He released"},{"c":"الْبَحْرَيْنِ","d":"l-baḥrayni","e":"the two seas"},{"c":"يَلْتَقِيَانِ","d":"yaltaqiyāni","e":"meeting"}],"a":{"g":"He released the two seas, meeting [side by side];"}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"بَيْنَهُمَا","d":"baynahumā","e":"Between both of them"},{"c":"بَرْزَخٌ","d":"barzakhun","e":"(is) a barrier"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَبْغِيَانِ","d":"yabghiyāni","e":"they transgress"}],"a":{"g":"Between them is a barrier [so] neither of them transgresses."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"فَبِأَيِّ","d":"fabi-ayyi","e":"So which"},{"c":"ءَالَاءِ","d":"ālāi","e":"(of the) favors"},{"c":"رَبِّكُمَا","d":"rabbikumā","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"تُكَذِّبَانِ","d":"tukadhibāni","e":"will you both deny"}],"a":{"g":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny?"}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"يَخْرُجُ","d":"yakhruju","e":"Come forth"},{"c":"مِنْهُمَا","d":"min'humā","e":"from both of them"},{"c":"اللُّؤْلُؤُ","d":"l-lu'lu-u","e":"the pearl"},{"c":"وَالْمَرْجَانُ","d":"wal-marjānu","e":"and the coral"}],"a":{"g":"From both of them emerge pearl and coral."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"فَبِأَيِّ","d":"fabi-ayyi","e":"So which"},{"c":"ءَالَاءِ","d":"ālāi","e":"(of the) favors"},{"c":"رَبِّكُمَا","d":"rabbikumā","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"تُكَذِّبَانِ","d":"tukadhibāni","e":"will you both deny"}],"a":{"g":"So which of the f