":"He"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"شَأْنٍ","d":"shanin","e":"a matter"}],"a":{"g":"Whoever is within the heavens and earth asks Him; every day He is bringing about a matter."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"فَبِأَيِّ","d":"fabi-ayyi","e":"So which"},{"c":"ءَالَاءِ","d":"ālāi","e":"(of the) favors"},{"c":"رَبِّكُمَا","d":"rabbikumā","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"تُكَذِّبَانِ","d":"tukadhibāni","e":"will you both deny"}],"a":{"g":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny?"}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"سَنَفْرُغُ","d":"sanafrughu","e":"Soon We will attend"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"to you"},{"c":"أَيُّهَ","d":"ayyuha","e":"O you"},{"c":"الثَّقَلَانِ","d":"l-thaqalāni","e":"two classes!"}],"a":{"g":"We will attend to you, O prominent beings."}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"فَبِأَيِّ","d":"fabi-ayyi","e":"So which"},{"c":"ءَالَاءِ","d":"ālāi","e":"(of the) favors"},{"c":"رَبِّكُمَا","d":"rabbikumā","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"تُكَذِّبَانِ","d":"tukadhibāni","e":"will you both deny"}],"a":{"g":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny?"}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"يَامَعْشَرَ","d":"yāmaʿshara","e":"O assembly"},{"c":"الْجِنِّ","d":"l-jini","e":"(of) the jinn"},{"c":"وَالْإِنْسِ","d":"wal-insi","e":"and the men!"},{"c":"إِنِ","d":"ini","e":"If"},{"c":"اسْتَطَعْتُمْ","d":"is'taṭaʿtum","e":"you are able"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"to"},{"c":"تَنْفُذُوا","d":"tanfudhū","e":"pass beyond"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"[of]"},{"c":"أَقْطَارِ","d":"aqṭāri","e":"(the) regions"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"(of) the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"فَانْفُذُوا","d":"fa-unfudhū","e":"then pass"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"تَنْفُذُونَ","d":"tanfudhūna","e":"you (can) pass"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"بِسُلْطَانٍ","d":"bisul'ṭānin","e":"by authority"}],"a":{"g":"O company of jinn and mankind, if you are able to pass beyond the regions of the heavens and the earth, then pass. You will not pass except by authority [